    "This cannot be taken back: it federates to every server that knows you. You will be asked for your password." : "Kjo s’mund të kthehet mbrapsht: federohet te çdo shërbyes që ju njeh. Do t’ju kërkohet fjalëkalimi juaj.",
    "Move my followers to the new account" : "Shpërngulni ndjekësit e mi te llogaria e re",
